---
/**
 * Science interlude — the statement of the regenerative principle. The
 * molecule behind it is the site-wide helix backdrop (HelixBackdrop), which
 * reaches its Activation state around here: the coil loosening, luminance
 * rising. This section supplies only the copy and the legibility gradient
 * that keeps it readable over the strand.
 */
---

<section class="relative flex min-h-screen items-center overflow-hidden" data-helix-state="activation" aria-labelledby="interlude-heading">
  <!-- soft teal stage glow -->
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"
    style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse 45% 60% at 72% 50%, rgba(45,212,191,0.07), transparent 65%);"
    aria-hidden="true"
  >
  </div>
  <!-- holographic lab atmosphere — blueprint grid -->
  <div class="grid-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <!-- legibility gradient behind the copy -->
  <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-ink via-ink/75 to-transparent lg:w-[62%]" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="wrap relative py-28 md:py-36">
    <div class="max-w-xl">
      <p class="eyebrow-teal" data-reveal>The Science of Regeneration</p>
      <h2 id="interlude-heading" class="mt-6 font-serif text-5xl leading-[1.04] text-cream md:text-7xl" data-reveal data-delay="0.1">
        Your body&rsquo;s own biology, <span class="text-teal italic">reactivated.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-8 max-w-md text-[15px] leading-[1.9] text-cream/65" data-reveal data-delay="0.2">
        The O Concept™ is built on a regenerative principle: platelet-rich plasma, growth factors and the body&rsquo;s
        own blood products, precisely deployed to reawaken cellular repair — new vessels, new tissue, restored
        function. Not masking the symptom; rebuilding the biology beneath it.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-11" data-reveal data-delay="0.3">
        <a href="#science" class="btn btn-teal" data-magnetic>Explore the Science</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
